OL,3,AMum's heartbreak over LA killing and
OL,4,Agranddaughter's location
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a Scottish law graduate
OL,7,Fkilled in Los Angeles says the lack of
OL,8,Finformation from US authorities since
OL,9,Fher daughter's death has been
OL,10,Fheartbreaking.
OL,12,FJune Bunyan's dismembered body was
OL,13,Ffound in her apartment in September
OL,14,Flast year.
OL,16,FHer husband Jonathan Renteria has been
OL,17,Fcharged with murder, mutilation and
OL,18,Fchild cruelty. He has pleaded not
OL,19,Fguilty.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
