OL,3,AMum's heartbreak over LA killing and
OL,4,Agranddaughter's location
OL,5,
OL,6,FJill Bunyan, June's mum, says she is in
OL,7,Flegal limbo and is still not certain
OL,8,Fwho is caring for her baby
OL,9,Fgranddaughter.
